&lt;div class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Harden base OS images and secure open-source dependencies, package managers, and the broader software supply chain.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
