&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This role is remote and must be based in Tokyo, Japan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
