&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You think like a founder. When you walk into a customer, you&#39;re curious about the business, digging into what&#39;s broken, and figuring out what to build that doesn&#39;t yet exist. You&#39;re scrappy and resourceful, you move fast enough to learn, and you&#39;re as comfortable in a strategic discussion with a CEO as you are deep in a codebase. You&#39;ve shipped actual products that real people use, that drove real outcomes - and you want to do it at a higher level of ambition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
