&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This role is hybrid (4 days a week in our Mountain View or San Francisco office)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
