&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain complete, organized, and retrievable documentation for each purchase (business requirement, PR, PO, Contract, SOW, Invoice, Estimates, Quotes, and pay terms).&lt;/li&gt;
