&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work closely with the Product lead and cross-functional partners across engineering, design, data, go-to-market, and customer-facing teams to identify the right product bets, bring structure to an ambiguous opportunity space, and translate enterprise intelligence concepts into concrete product experiences. We’re currently a very lean product team, so you’ll have an outsized role in shaping both the product roadmap and the product team itself. This role is ideal for someone with 5+ years of experience, a deep industry overview and passion for AI, and the ability to demonstrate granular product implementation skills such as designing specific user interfaces and workflows rather than staying at a high conceptual level.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
