&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Quality Assurance Engineer to assess the quality of our web application through Manual &amp;amp; Automation testing. You will be responsible for finding and reporting bugs and glitches with the initial level of RCA. You should have a keen eye for detail and excellent communication skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
